6
00:00:13,663 --> 00:00:17,240
Mudah dicari itu dibangun oleh empat hal.

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:20,523
Pertama, satu aturan nama berkas.

8
00:00:20,523 --> 00:00:23,546
Tanggal, jenis, lalu nama.

9
00:00:23,546 --> 00:00:26,114
