11
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:31,497
Ketiga, ada penanggung jawab.

12
00:00:31,497 --> 00:00:34,480
Satu orang yang memegang kuncinya.

13
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:35,430
Keempat,

14
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:38,499
